  "description": "The all-new XtC Jr. 24+ is designed to give young riders more confidence and control as they begin a life of off-road adventures. Featuring a lightweight ALUXX aluminum frame with a low stand-over height and geometry designed for smaller bodies, it has stable handling to help ride tricky sections of trail. Its specially sized, smaller diameter 24-inch wheels come with extra-wide 2.8-inch tires, which add comfort and traction. The soft, cushy tires can be ridden with lower air pressure, giving the bike a smooth ride on rocky, bumpy trails. It also features a lightweight, easy-to-use 1x9 drivetrain, powerful disc brakes, and youth-sized components for added comfort and control.",
